  "prefLabel": "Per 202.03 Limitations on Public Participation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 202.03 Limitations on Public Participation. The director or person designated by the director to preside over a hearing shall refuse to recognize for speaking or revoke the recognition of any person who:\n\n(a) Speaks or acts in an abusive or disruptive manner;\n\n(b) Fails to keep comments relevant to the proposed rules that are the subject matter of the hearing; or\n\n(c) Restates more than once what they, or the entity upon whose behalf they are speaking, has already stated.\n\nSource. #8736, eff 10-18-06; ss by #14441, eff 12-1-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/per100-1500.html"
